{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13504","headline":"巫山之阳香谿之阴明妃神女旧迹存焉 · 蒋冽","name":"巫山之阳香谿之阴明妃神女旧迹存焉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神女归巫峡，明妃入汉宫。\n捣衣余石在，荐枕旧室空。\n行雨有时度，谿流何日穷。\n至今词赋里，凄怆写遗风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13504.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13504","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}